### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### MongoDB health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/db-health/

### Sensor ingestion
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/sensor-data/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensor_id": "eosm-demo-01",
  "temperature": 26.2,
  "humidity": 58,
  "timestamp": "2025-12-06T10:00:00Z"
}

### EOSM prediction (stub)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/eosm/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "eosm-demo-01",
  "metrics": {
    "vibration_rms": 0.12,
    "temperature": 26.2,
    "pressure": 1.02
  },
  "context": {
    "mode": "test",
    "line": "A1"
  }
}

